{
  "_comment": [
    "THE Anthropic rate table. One physical file, copied to the output of every app that",
    "references AiObservatory.Data and loaded via AddJsonFile, so the API and the Ingest",
    "worker cannot hold divergent copies. Do not paste these rates into an appsettings.json.",
    "",
    "Resolution is longest-prefix, date-windowed, dated-beats-undated -- see",
    "AiObservatory.Data.Pricing.AnthropicPricingResolver. A time-bounded price is expressed",
    "as two rows sharing a ModelPrefix (see claude-sonnet-5 below), never as a code branch.",
    "",
    "CacheWrite is the FIVE-MINUTE rate (1.25x base input); CacheWrite1h is the ONE-HOUR rate",
    "(2x base input). Both are transcribed from the published per-model columns rather than",
    "derived from the multipliers, so a model that ever departs from 1.25x/2x stays correct.",
    "An event's CacheWrite1hTokens is the one-hour SUBSET of its CacheWriteTokens; the",
    "remainder prices at the five-minute rate.",
    "",
    "Verified against https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing on 2026-07-26",
    "(columns: Base Input / 5m Cache Writes / 1h Cache Writes / Cache Hits & Refreshes /",
    "Output). Three prefixes are not on that page because the models are retired and were",
    "dropped from it -- claude-3-opus, claude-3-sonnet and claude-3-haiku. Their CacheWrite1h",
    "is the documented 2x base input; they are kept only so historical rows still resolve.",
    "",
    "The section key is 'Ingest:Anthropic' for compatibility with deployed configuration."
  ],
